WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
- The Philpotts are at odds,

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.800
merging their different design styles.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.350
And, before the break, Cass and Ted

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.880
each gave opening statements,

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.970
defending why their space needs to

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:11.630
kind of speak to their needs.

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:13.900
And Cass wants a tranquil reading room,

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.420
and Ted wants a game room to
entertain family and friends.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:21.420
Well, Ted, we wanted to
bring in reinforcements.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:25.080
He has a surprise witness to
help him drive his case home.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.070
Mikel?

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:28.700
- Yes, Ted, go ahead and tell us

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:32.000
who our surprise witness is.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.230
- I brought in the big gun.

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:34.070
I brought in the woman

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:36.400
who really makes the
decisions in the house,

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.888
and that's our 15 year old daughter.

00:00:37.888 --> 00:00:39.720
(crowd laughing)

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:40.553
(crowd cheering)
- Is this Elle?

00:00:40.553 --> 00:00:42.280
- It is Elle Philpott.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:43.113
Come on out.

00:00:43.113 --> 00:00:48.047
- Elle!
(crowd cheering)

00:00:49.331 --> 00:00:50.854
Oh, Elle!

00:00:50.854 --> 00:00:53.780
Oh, Elle, I've been so
excited to meet you.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.883
Doing my research on you,
you are such a good girl.

00:00:55.883 --> 00:00:57.643
- Thank you, thank you.

00:00:57.643 --> 00:00:59.170
- She is a good girl.

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:00.020
- Oh my God.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:00.983
- I don't know if I like this though.

00:01:00.983 --> 00:01:02.440
It's not fair.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:03.580
- Yeah, it does seem like

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.640
you're siding with dad on this one.

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:06.610
- Speak your truth, Elle.

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:07.770
Live in the truth.
- Yeah.

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:08.860
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.620
I love you, but I have to defend dad,

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:12.700
because I think we need a game room,

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.120
so I can hang out with my friends,

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:16.022
and you're always saying
you want me home more.

00:01:16.022 --> 00:01:19.410
- Okay, Ted, that was
a pretty smooth move.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:20.243
I mean, God-
- Thank you.

00:01:20.243 --> 00:01:22.000
- [Drew] You really brought
down the gavel with Elle.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:22.870
- I wanna win.

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:24.014
- I think it's only fair that

00:01:24.014 --> 00:01:26.550
I bring in a surprise witness.

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:27.383
And I think I'm gonna do it-

00:01:27.383 --> 00:01:29.110
- [Mikel] Well, who is your witness?

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:30.830
- I'm gonna bring in a professional.

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:31.663
- Oh!

00:01:31.663 --> 00:01:34.340
- None other than interior designer

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:37.110
and co-host of Queer Eye, Bobby Berk.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.720
- Oh, you playing dirty.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:40.943
(crowd cheering)

00:01:40.943 --> 00:01:42.360
- I'm really excited,

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:46.010
because also there is another
detail here you need to know.

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:48.050
Ted has this diver's helmet

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:50.450
that is his grandfather's,

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.200
but I feel like you really wanna make it

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:53.660
a statement piece.

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:56.853
And, just speaking as a woman,

00:01:57.990 --> 00:02:01.760
this, I don't think I would
want as a centerpiece in design,

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.560
but the sentimentality
really speaks to me,

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:07.410
so I'm curious as to what
Bobby has to say about it.

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:09.100
Let's roll the tape.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:10.220
- Hey, Drew and Mikel,

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:11.290
it's Bobby Berk here,

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:14.070
and I 100 percent object
to the divine helmet

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:15.770
Ted wants to add to this room.

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:16.862
I love a piece that tells a story,

00:02:16.862 --> 00:02:18.379
but this is not the story

00:02:18.379 --> 00:02:20.460
that we wanna tell in this room.

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:21.970
This space should be a sanctuary,

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:25.620
and not a reminder of stressful
stuff like battleships.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.580
So, lady and gentlemen of the jury,

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.410
I implore you to side
with Cass on this issue.

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:32.542
The helmet is not it.

00:02:32.542 --> 00:02:34.931
(crowd cheering)

00:02:34.931 --> 00:02:38.480
- Overruled, overruled, overruled.

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:39.750
We need to throw that out.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:40.870
That's overruled.

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:42.550
- I have to agree with Bobby on that one,

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:44.782
and he is a fantastic expert.

00:02:44.782 --> 00:02:47.365
(upbeat music)

